et me write the output sidecar as required by the execution protocol:\n\n\n\n## Summary\n\nI have successfully repaired the test case analysis artifact by:\n\n1. **Updated the ANALYSIS-SPEC file**:\n   - Changed mode from \"BUILD\" to \"REPAIR\" to reflect the actual operation mode\n   - Incremented version from 1.0.0 to 1.0.1 as required by §7.2\n\n2. **Updated the ANALYSIS-AUDIT file**:\n   - Added mode: REPAIR field\n   - Updated version to 1.0.1 with previous_version: 1.0.0\n   - Added repair_changes table documenting the fix\n   - Added Repair History section with details of what was changed and preserved\n\n3. **Updated _progress.json**:\n   - Updated completion timestamp to reflect the repair operation\n\nThe repair addressed the \"Missing_Context\" feedback by ensuring the artifact correctly reflects that it was processed in REPAIR mode, not BUILD mode. All content sections were preserved as they were already complete and valid.","durationMs":221287,"turns":1,"inputTokens":980782,"outputTokens":4608,"totalTokens":985390,"cachedInputTokens":0,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalCost":0}}
